<ul>
<li><b>PDF manuals: keycaps audited across both books.</b> A Key column that is not the first column (the Reviewer Guide's drawing-tools table) is capped; "B sketch, A arrow" in the annotations chapter caps B and A like R; "Press Tab" and "Delete removes it" are keycaps. Bold A and B stay plain where they name the two sides of a compare.</li>
</ul>
